    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_4980",
      "reading_order": 6899,
      "severity": "caution",
      "content": "CAUTION: Some parts are sensitive to electrostatic discharge (ESD). Always perform service",
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 316.66182999999995,
        "r": 181.75,
        "b": 305.07183
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_1873",
      "reading_order": 6901,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 191.521137805881,
        "t": 320.8151550292969,
        "r": 210.41326045356848,
        "b": 299.2521057128906
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_1873.png",
      "decorative": true,
      "width": 18,
      "height": 21,
      "image_hash": "d5426d3ef540d275230978a5d152af1f7bea8d5fdf8bd23f3d9951d93b2f4c5f",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_4981",
      "next_block_id": "txt_4982"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_4982",
      "reading_order": 6902,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 298.04681,
        "r": 549.7700400000001,
        "b": 262.4568099999999
      },
      "content": "work at an ESD-protected workstation or mat. If an ESD workstation or mat is not available, touch the sheet-metal chassis to provide a static ground before touching an ESD-sensitive assembly. Protect the ESD-sensitive assemblies by placing them in ESD pouches when they are out of the printer."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_4983",
      "reading_order": 6903,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00004,
        "t": 253.04681000000005,
        "r": 548.6300400000002,
        "b": 217.4568099999999
      },
      "content": "If the replacement part is a roller or pad, avoid touching the spongy part of it. Skin oils on the roller or pad can cause paper pickup and/or print-quality problems. HP recommends using disposable gloves when handling rollers or pads or washing your hands before touching rollers or pads."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_4984",
      "reading_order": 6904,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 208.04683999999997,
        "r": 541.73,
        "b": 184.45684000000006
      },
      "content": "IMPORTANT: Make sure that all of the shipping materials (for example shipping tape) are removed from the replacement part prior to installation."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_4985",
      "reading_order": 6905,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.0,
        "t": 173.54683,
        "r": 343.02,
        "b": 161.95683000000008
      },
      "content": "To install an assembly, reverse the removal steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_4986",
      "reading_order": 6906,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00002,
        "t": 152.54683,
        "r": 551.6100400000003,
        "b": 116.95683000000008
      },
      "content": "When applicable, special installation instructions are provided for an assembly at the end of the removal procedure. Always completely read the removal instructions and follow all special installation instructions."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_4987",
      "reading_order": 6907,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.00004,
        "t": 107.54683,
        "r": 295.6000399999999,
        "b": 95.95683000000008
      },
      "content": "Install the optional 550-sheet paper feeder."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_4988",
      "reading_order": 6908,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.00006,
        "t": 86.54683,
        "r": 510.8700600000001,
        "b": 74.95683000000008
      },
      "content": "Remove the orange shipping tape, and then place the printer on the replacement accessory."
    }
